    "['authentication-scheme [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set access profile default authentication-order radius', 'parent_command': ['set system host-name [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set system host-name [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': 'Here\\'s the equivalent Juniper configuration command for `authentication-scheme default`:\\n\\n##\\nset access profile default authentication-order radius\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper, the `authentication-scheme` concept is implemented differently. The closest equivalent is configuring the authentication order in an access profile, where you specify RADIUS as the authentication method. The \"default\" is represented by creating a profile named \"default\". \\n\\nJuniper doesn\\'t have an exact 1:1 mapping for Huawei\\'s authentication-scheme command, but this is the functionally equivalent configuration that achieves the same purpose of using RADIUS authentication.', 'trans_template': 'set access profile default authentication-order radius'}]]": 1,
